WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480 line:88%
Connect intervention to the skill that breaks down.

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:07.770 line:88%
For language, expand vocabulary, sentence structure, social communication, and

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:08.630 line:88%
narrative organization.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:13.630 line:88%
For speech, build the sound repertoire, coordinate vocal movements,

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:15.330 line:88%
and connect listening with production.

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:18.910 line:88%
In the lecture's example, the child says sew for

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:19.610 line:88%
soap.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:22.370 line:88%
First check whether the child can hear the difference

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:23.190 line:88%
between the words.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:27.070 line:88%
Then work toward producing and using the final consonant.

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:31.090 line:88%
The sound contrast supports a meaningful difference between two

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:31.790 line:88%
words.

00:00:32.631 --> 00:00:36.671 line:88%
Cochlear implant outcomes depend on a combination of factors.

00:00:37.471 --> 00:00:41.811 line:88%
Age at implantation, experience using the device, consistent use,

00:00:42.151 --> 00:00:46.051 line:88%
earlier hearing, the map, family support, communication mode, educational

00:00:46.051 --> 00:00:48.671 line:88%
setting, and cognition all matter in this lecture.

00:00:49.571 --> 00:00:52.931 line:88%
Earlier access can support speech development, while practice connects

00:00:52.931 --> 00:00:54.531 line:88%
access with useful communication.

00:00:55.331 --> 00:00:58.171 line:88%
Keep this separate from acquired hearing loss after speech

00:00:58.171 --> 00:00:58.871 line:88%
has developed.

00:00:59.671 --> 00:01:02.671 line:88%
In that case, reduced auditory feedback can gradually affect

00:01:02.671 --> 00:01:03.641 line:88%
intelligibility.

00:01:04.441 --> 00:01:07.101 line:88%
The mechanism is loss of feedback for an established

00:01:07.101 --> 00:01:09.601 line:88%
skill, rather than learning the skill for the first

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:10.301 line:88%
time.
